{
 "id": "elixir",
 "version": "0.2.0",
 "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
 "title": "Elixir",
 "description": "ELIXIR, a drum-synthesis machine for the Digitakt II: four voice models after the open-source firmware of the Sonic Potions LXR drum machine (GPL-3.0) in one machine: MODEL picks DRUM (carrier, FM modulator, pitch sweep), SNARE (carrier plus band-passed sample-and-hold noise), CYMBAL (carrier FM'd by two square modulators) or HIHAT (the same, thinner and high-passed); every model has the LXR's pitch sweep and transients (snap, two click samples, noise). Two SRC pages; the Digitakt's FILTER, AMP, LFO and overdrive do the rest. A machine mod on core-dt2 2.4: machine type 12 (replaces DrumVoice), parameters 280-290, and its DSP voice routine. Experimental.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "elekloader port; voices after the LXR drum machine firmware (Erica Synths, GPL-3.0); DSP entry after DigiKit's (Em D)",
 "device": "digitakt-mk2",
 "os": "1.17",
